{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets","id":875261,"title":"Mage 2E Char Sheets","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-26T21:42:16-07:00","id":875261,"title":"Mage 2E Char Sheets","content":"EDIT: Mr. Gone ended making fan sheets for Mage 2E. Here is link for them - <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/mta2nded.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/mta2nded.html</a> !!! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> So we need to wait at least one more week for 2E corebook. I thought that we need to occupy ourselves with some project and remembering how we need to wait few weeks for <b>Werewolf</b> 2E sheets after premier \u2013 I propose we made our version of sheet so <b>Mr Gone</b> could make them in the meantime. I invite you all to comment on those ideas and maybe propose your own.<br /> <br /> First, let\u2019s look on <b>GMC</b> <b>Mage</b> sheet for now\u2026<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/zbE3axE.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LdPcfQN.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> In my point of view, first page is all good, really. Until we do not know if there will be some large changes as critical mechanics, first page can be as it is. We only would need to change fonts for Second Edition ones, but it\u2019s minor thing.<br /> <br /> The we go to second page \u2013 and here is list of things I would change:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Shorter Active Spells section</b> \u2013 in 2E it\u2019s only equal to you Gnosis, so 10 lines max here.</li> <li><b>Longer Nimbus section</b> \u2013 We now have Signature Nimbus and there was mechanic that give environment your Nimbus Tilt.</li> <li><b>Removing Paradox Marks section</b> \u2013 from <b>Dark Eras</b> we know that now Paradox effects works as Conditions, so they end on first page.</li> <li><b>Shorter Rotes Section</b> \u2013 I do not know any character that would fill it in their gaming career \u2013 maybe 15 lines?</li> <li><b>Enchanted Items and Combat</b> moved lower, on bottom of page.</li> <li>Instead of <b>Familiar</b> ( that is niche thing ) give here <b>Praxis</b> and <b>Wisdom Inures</b> sections. Familiar can easily become next sheet for those that use them, but Praxis and Inures are more crucial to all characters.</li> <li><b>Magical Tools</b> \u2013 Do not think it\u2019s need changing. Maybe renaming it\u2019s just for <b>Yantras</b> section?</li> </ol><b>Addition:</b> We have new <b>Mage</b> font samples from <b>Dark Eras </b>\u2013 if someone recognize those, please write the name of font.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/yzGTaAO.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-14-2016, 10:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T21:59:17-07:00","id":875274,"title":"","content":"Very nice, you trying to be CroD's Mister Gone? You have a good start but let me warn you. It's a big job.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2682-kumiko","name":"Kumiko","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2682_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T22:12:45-07:00","id":875288,"title":"","content":"We would need to add Praxes to the sheet. <br /> <br /> Also Mr. Gone, if you are reading this, you are my hero. Let me buy you some drinks sometime (after 2e sheets come out, of course <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2535-arthexis","name":"arthexis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T22:19:27-07:00","id":875296,"title":"","content":"Shouldn't we, uh... Wait for the book to come out so we know what will needs to go on the sheet?<br /> <br /> Not to mention, the PDFs for both Werewolf and Vampire came with an official sheet made by Mr. Gone. I would be very surprised if the same wasn't true for Mage, and if that's the case, the sheet is probably made already. It's just waiting for the book to come out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 04-27-2016, 01:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"