86710,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Justin Sane</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=886667#post886667\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Straight type, please. That way, the sheets won't need to be updated whenever a new book comes along <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Good point. Though, I always set my form fields so things can be typed in if they aren't on the list.. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T16:25:51-07:00","id":886729,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=882917#post882917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>WHW</b>, challange accepted! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> So, my comment how to make <i>usable</i> fan sheet. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> All changes are to second page of sheet, first is fine as original: <ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Shorter Rote section</b> \u2013 we need only about 12 lines of those, large part went to the Praxes from previous weight.</li> <li><b>Add long</b> <b>Nimbus</b> section with 3 lines, on second on wrote \u201cTilt\u201d instead of delete Rotes lines.</li> <li><b>Shorter Active spells </b>\u2013 Max is Gnosis and Gnosis is 10, so we cannot have more than 10 Active spells.</li> <li><b>Add Yantras</b> lines in place of delete Active spells lines</li> <li><b>Throw out Familiar section </b>\u2013 he will get his own sheet.</li> <li><b>In place of Familiar \u2013 we put two new columns:</b></li> <li><b>First, Wisdom Inures </b>\u2013 up to 10 lines.</li> <li><b>Second, Legacies Attainments \u2013 10 lines, as 2 spells could be per each dot of Attainments.</b></li> <li><b>Rename</b> previous Attainment section to <b>Arcana Attainments</b>.</li> </ol><br /> Here you got my second page mock. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a>, I hope it helps with making fan sheet.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/bdOu2RU.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Looking at your mockup, I have a few questions. If we're removing the familiar section, what if we put the two Attainments sections together, either on the right hand hand, or where the familar section used to be. That way they're either right next to each other, or in a row. What do you think? And which would you prefer if we do that.<br /> <br /> <br /> Also, for a 4 page sheet, looking at the my original 4 pager, how does it look? What changes are needed, if any?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T17:05:30-07:00","id":886759,"title":"","content":"Also, for the Nimbus Tilt, the explanation of the Tilt itself shouldn't be longer than the Nimbus description, perhaps just one line is needed, two lines at most (so maybe 2 lines for Nimbus desc, 2 lines for Nimbus Tilt stats?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2535-arthexis","name":"arthexis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T17:08:59-07:00","id":886762,"title":"","content":"Here is how example Nimbus Tilt description can look:<br /> +1 EMPATHY -1 WITS +1 STRENGTH<br /> <br /> That's all you need to put in the Tilt space. I assume rest is a part of the Nimbus description.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T17:11:36-07:00","id":886766,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>arthexis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=886759#post886759\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, for the Nimbus Tilt, the explanation of the Tilt itself shouldn't be longer than the Nimbus description, perhaps just one line is needed, two lines at most (so maybe 2 lines for Nimbus desc, 2 lines for Nimbus Tilt stats?)</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, I can do that. Thanks!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=886762#post886762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here is how example Nimbus Tilt description can look:<br /> +1 EMPATHY -1 WITS +1 STRENGTH<br /> <br /> That's all you need to put in the Tilt space. I assume rest is a part of the Nimbus description.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, seems so. So I think I'll do 2 lines for each? Nimbus doesn't need a name or title or anything, right?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 05-09-2016, 08:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T17:34:37-07:00","id":886790,"title":"","content":"Nah, it's just a short description, something like, &quot;A strong wind that comes from below&quot; or &quot;A looming shadow that seems to be standing in watch behind the mage and cows them away.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2535-arthexis","name":"arthexis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T21:41:27-07:00","id":886958,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=886664#post886664\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, would some kind soul be willing to type lists for the drop down menus for the new Mage sheet? Or would people prefer just some straight type in fields for some of it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Drop downs can be in two places - Paths and Orders. They do not change in whole gameline.<br /> <br /> <b>Path:</b><br /> Acanthus<br /> Mastigos<br /> Moros<br /> Obrimos<br /> Thyrsus<br /> <br /> <b>Order</b> - First should be blank or editable - Some people will need to write Ministry or name of Nameless Order here. Could be made spearation between sects with line &quot;---&quot; or something. List:<br /> <br /> <b>Order:</b><br /> &quot; &quot;<br /> &quot;-----&quot;<br /> Adamantine Arrow<br /> Free Council<br /> Guardians of Veil<br /> Mysterium<br /> Silver Ladder<br /> \u200b&quot;-----&quot;<br /> Seers of Throne<br /> Hegemony<br /> Panopticon<br /> Paternoster<br /> Praetorian<br /> \u200b&quot;-----&quot;<br /> Apostate<br /> Nameless<br /> <br /> Also, example Virtue and Vice looks like this - first should be editable, as always with new V&amp;V<br /> <br /> <b>Virtue:<br /> &quot; &quot;</b><br /> Ambitious<br /> Courageous<br /> Generous<br /> Honest<br /> Hopeful<br /> Just<br /> Loving<br /> Loyal<br /> Patient<br /> Trustworthy<br /> <br /> <b>Vice:<br /> &quot; &quot;</b><br /> Ambitious<br /> Addictive<br /> Corrupt<br /> Cruel<br /> Deceitful<br /> Dogmatic<br /> Greedy<br /> Hasty<br /> Hateful<br /> Pessimistic<br /> <br /> Rest can be all straigtht up type ins.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>arthexis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=886759#post886759\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, for the Nimbus Tilt, the explanation of the Tilt itself shouldn't be longer than the Nimbus description, perhaps just one line is needed, two lines at most (so maybe 2 lines for Nimbus desc, 2 lines for Nimbus Tilt stats?)</div> </div> </div> </div>You forget about Signature Nimbus, that is also one line to add to this section.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T21:45:58-07:00","id":886959,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=886729#post886729\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Looking at your mockup, I have a few questions. If we're removing the familiar section, what if we put the two Attainments sections together, either on the right hand hand, or where the familar section used to be. That way they're either right next to each other, or in a row. What do you think? And which would you prefer if we do that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Could be but you need to highly seperatee them somehow - Arcana and Legacy Attainments can easily mix up and they are totally two different things. Maybe put bold line between them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T21:49:35-07:00","id":886961,"title":"","content":"Oh, in my mind Signature Nimbus is kinda the same as Intense Nimbus and not requiring a separate area. Book says the Signature Nimbus always looks like a byproduct of the Intense Nimbus, and it is almost evident that one is connected to the other. <br /> <br /> I guess the extra space makes sense in 4 page sheets but not on 2 page ones?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2535-arthexis","name":"arthexis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T15:34:51-07:00","id":888618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>arthexis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=886790#post886790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nah, it's just a short description, something like, &quot;A strong wind that comes from below&quot; or &quot;A looming shadow that seems to be standing in watch behind the mage and cows them away.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, ok. Cool.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=886958#post886958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Drop downs can be in two places - Paths and Orders. They do not change in whole gameline.<br /> <br /> &lt;snip&gt;<br /> <br /> Rest can be all straigtht up type ins.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cool, thanks! I appreciate it.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=886959#post886959\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could be but you need to highly seperatee them somehow - Arcana and Legacy Attainments can easily mix up and they are totally two different things. Maybe put bold line between them?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll see what I can do. The two columns will be labeled though...<br /> <br /> I just thought with them both being called &quot;attainments&quot; it made sense to put them close to each other, rather than in opposite corners of the sheet...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T23:20:20-07:00","id":888878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=888618#post888618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll see what I can do. The two columns will be labeled though...<br /> <br /> I just thought with them both being called &quot;attainments&quot; it made sense to put them close to each other, rather than in opposite corners of the sheet...</div> </div> </div> </div>I see what you get there, but from fans reactions - those Attainments can easily be mixed up, and they are totally different thing, sharing only name. Putting them inside one frame has reasons, but you need to separate them graphically - like maybe vertical line between columns.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-12-2016, 02:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}]