"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T14:43:28-07:00","id":890807,"title":"","content":"Just one thing: the footer text (the one that tells you how to create characters) is wrong, you have the one for 1st Ed instead of 2nd.<br /> <br /> But the reason behind the error is that... the official sheet is also wrong XD It might be OK to fix it until they have added the errata to the original.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2535-arthexis","name":"arthexis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T16:37:50-07:00","id":890862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>arthexis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=890807#post890807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just one thing: the footer text (the one that tells you how to create characters) is wrong, you have the one for 1st Ed instead of 2nd.<br /> <br /> But the reason behind the error is that... the official sheet is also wrong XD It might be OK to fix it until they have added the errata to the original.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ha! I was about to say that I just copied it from the official sheet. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> If someone knows what it should be corrected to though, let me know and I'll update it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T21:46:27-07:00","id":890988,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=890862#post890862\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ha! I was about to say that I just copied it from the official sheet. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> If someone knows what it should be corrected to though, let me know and I'll update it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019ve got you covered.<ul><li>Add <i>\u201cAspirations 3\u201d</i> <i>and \u201cObsessions \u2013 1 at Gnosis 1 or 2, 2 at Gnosis 3\u201d</i> before the Attributes section.</li> <li>Add <i>\u201c+1 dot in any Resistance Attribute\u201d</i> after <i>\u201cAttributes 5/4/3\u201d</i> and remove <i>\u201cFavored Resistance Attribute \u2013 Acanthus, Moros, Thyrsus +1 Composure; Mastigos, Obrimos: +1 Resolve\u201d</i>.</li> <li>Add <i>\u201c+1 dot of Occult if in an Order\u201d</i> after <i>\u201dSkills 11/7/4\u201d</i> and before <i>\u201c(+3 Specialties)\u201d</i></li> <li>Replace <i>\u201cArcana \u2013 2 dots in 1<sup>st</sup> Arcanum, 2 dots in 2<sup>nd</sup>, 1 dot in 3<sup>rd</sup> (two of these must be the Path\u2019s Ruling Arcana) + 1 dot in any Arcanum\u201d</i> with <i>\u201cArcana \u2013 6 dots, none over 3, at least 1 dot in each Ruling Arcanum, none in Inferior Arcanum\u201d</i></li> <li>Add <i>\u201cPraxes \u2013 1 per dot of Gnosis\u201d</i> after the Arcana section and before the Rotes section.</li> <li>It might be a good idea to replace <i>\u201cRotes 6\u201d</i> with <i>Rotes \u2013 choose spells with 6 total dots\u201d</i>, because Rotes don\u2019t actually have dot values anymore, but are chosen based on the dot levels of the spells at character creation.</li> <li>Replace <i>\u201cMerits 7\u201d</i> with <i>\u201cMerits 10\u201d</i></li> <li>Remove <i>\u201c(Buying the 5<sup>th</sup> dot in Attriibutes, Skills or Merits costs 2 points)\u201d</i></li> </ul><br /> I think that should do it for the small text at the bottom. I\u2019d also like to add that \u201cWisdom Inures\u201d sounds kind of awkward, and isn\u2019t actually a term used in the book. I think it would make more sense to change the header for that section to \u201cInured Spells\u201d.<br /> <br /> <br /> Awesome sheet by the way! It really came together nicely, thank you to everyone who contributed, and to Mr. Gone for taking the time to put it all together.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T22:26:50-07:00","id":890998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=890988#post890988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[*]It might be a good idea to replace <i>\u201cRotes 6\u201d</i> with <i>Rotes \u2013 choose spells with 6 total dots\u201d</i>, because Rotes don\u2019t actually have dot values anymore, but are chosen based on the dot levels of the spells at character creation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is really weird, by the way - all Rotes cost 1 XP after character generation, but during it, for some reason some Rotes can cost 3 times as much as other. This leads to awkward situation where two characters with the same suite of Rotes can end up having to pay different amount of XP for them, simply because one bought XYZ at chargen and XYZ during game, and the other one did it the other way :/. Someone who chooses two 3rd dot Rotes overpays 4 XP for it, which is...well...upgrading their Arcanum by 1 :/.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T23:23:12-07:00","id":891007,"title":"","content":"I have another suggestion/request, but it would take more significant alteration to the sheet, so maybe it could be an alternative version. Sorry I'm late to the party here, I understand if this would be a lower priority. Personally, I don't see myself getting much use out of the Yantras and Magical Tools lines. Maybe one line for &quot;Deadicated Magical Tool&quot;, but that'd be it. Everything else in that left-hand section could be shifted up, and the bottom of the second page could become a section labeled Attainments. On the left there could be a sort of table with 10 rows (each labeled with the name of one of the 10 Arcana) and 4 colums, labeled &quot;Counterspell&quot;, &quot;Mage Armor&quot;, &quot;Targeted Summoning&quot;, and &quot;Create Rote&quot;, and the fields could just be checkboxes. To the right of that table you could have three colums with 10 fillable lines each, labeled &quot;Lesser Utility&quot;, &quot;Greater Utility&quot;, and &quot;Legacy&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 05-15-2016, 03:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T23:24:14-07:00","id":891009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=890998#post890998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which is really weird, by the way - all Rotes cost 1 XP after character generation, but during it, for some reason some Rotes can cost 3 times as much as other. This leads to awkward situation where two characters with the same suite of Rotes can end up having to pay different amount of XP for them, simply because one bought XYZ at chargen and XYZ during game, and the other one did it the other way :/. Someone who chooses two 3rd dot Rotes overpays 4 XP for it, which is...well...upgrading their Arcanum by 1 :/.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it's super weird. I'm kind of hoping that gets changed in the errata, but I'm not counting on it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T01:03:09-07:00","id":891031,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=890998#post890998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which is really weird, by the way - all Rotes cost 1 XP after character generation, but during it, for some reason some Rotes can cost 3 times as much as other. This leads to awkward situation where two characters with the same suite of Rotes can end up having to pay different amount of XP for them, simply because one bought XYZ at chargen and XYZ during game, and the other one did it the other way :/. Someone who chooses two 3rd dot Rotes overpays 4 XP for it, which is...well...upgrading their Arcanum by 1 :/.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree. I think I'm going to just take the average and say &quot;pick 3 rotes your character is capable of casting&quot; and call it a day. Hopefully it gets errated to something similar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6731-sobran","name":"Sobran","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T04:17:24-07:00","id":891082,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=891007#post891007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have another suggestion/request, but it would take more significant alteration to the sheet, so maybe it could be an alternative version. Sorry I'm late to the party here, I understand if this would be a lower priority. Personally, I don't see myself getting much use out of the Yantras and Magical Tools lines. Maybe one line for &quot;Deadicated Magical Tool&quot;, but that'd be it. Everything else in that left-hand section could be shifted up, and the bottom of the second page could become a section labeled Attainments. On the left there could be a sort of table with 10 rows (each labeled with the name of one of the 10 Arcana) and 4 colums, labeled &quot;Counterspell&quot;, &quot;Mage Armor&quot;, &quot;Targeted Summoning&quot;, and &quot;Create Rote&quot;, and the fields could just be checkboxes. To the right of that table you could have three colums with 10 fillable lines each, labeled &quot;Lesser Utility&quot;, &quot;Greater Utility&quot;, and &quot;Legacy&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yantras and Magical Tools would work great written on cards - you could write down commonly used Yantras (or even their types) and Tools, and apply them to your spellcasting visually, by adding them next to each other on the table. Moving dice in pairs as a visual help for setting Spell Factors works very well*, so I think this could be a similar case. I love such things, because you can signal your mechanical actions during narration without breaking the flow - you talk and describe, while physically moving &quot;the things&quot;, and everyone know what is going on and how many dice do you sell and what tools do you apply.<br /> <br /> Plus a lot of people would love to have their favorite tools on a card with some sweet description or drawing on it.<br /> <br /> *Wyrd's Cheat Sheet is great for this, as you can just put the number of dice you trade for factors on a Factor Table, so it's visually clear how you spend them and what you get in return. It help cast things on fly, because as silly as it sounds, it's easier than keeping the math in your head. It also adds a certain...ritual to the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","user":"WHW","date":". 05-15-2016, 07:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T06:07:38-07:00","id":891105,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=891082#post891082\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yantras and Magical Tools would work great written on cards - you could write down commonly used Yantras (or even their types) and Tools, and apply them to your spellcasting visually, by adding them next to each other on the table. Moving dice in pairs as a visual help for setting Spell Factors works very well*, so I think this could be a similar case. I love such things, because you can signal your mechanical actions during narration without breaking the flow - you talk and describe, while physically moving &amp;quot;the things&amp;quot;, and everyone know what is going on and how many dice do you sell and what tools do you apply.<br /> <br /> Plus a lot of people would love to have their favorite tools on a card with some sweet description or drawing on it.<br /> <br /> *Wyrd's Cheat Sheet is great for this, as you can just put the number of dice you trade for factors on a Factor Table, so it's visually clear how you spend them and what you get in return. It help cast things on fly, because as silly as it sounds, it's easier than keeping the math in your head. It also adds a certain...ritual to the game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah I could see that being much more useful than having lines for them on thr character sheet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T08:39:55-07:00","id":891166,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=890988#post890988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I\u2019ve got you covered.<ul><li>Add <i>\u201cAspirations 3\u201d</i> <i>and \u201cObsessions \u2013 1 at Gnosis 1 or 2, 2 at Gnosis 3\u201d</i> before the Attributes section.</li> <li>Add <i>\u201c+1 dot in any Resistance Attribute\u201d</i> after <i>\u201cAttributes 5/4/3\u201d</i> and remove <i>\u201cFavored Resistance Attribute \u2013 Acanthus, Moros, Thyrsus +1 Composure; Mastigos, Obrimos: +1 Resolve\u201d</i>.</li> <li>Add <i>\u201c+1 dot of Occult if in an Order\u201d</i> after <i>\u201dSkills 11/7/4\u201d</i> and before <i>\u201c(+3 Specialties)\u201d</i></li> <li>Replace <i>\u201cArcana \u2013 2 dots in 1<sup>st</sup> Arcanum, 2 dots in 2<sup>nd</sup>, 1 dot in 3<sup>rd</sup> (two of these must be the Path\u2019s Ruling Arcana) + 1 dot in any Arcanum\u201d</i> with <i>\u201cArcana \u2013 6 dots, none over 3, at least 1 dot in each Ruling Arcanum, none in Inferior Arcanum\u201d</i></li> <li>Add <i>\u201cPraxes \u2013 1 per dot of Gnosis\u201d</i> after the Arcana section and before the Rotes section.</li> <li>It might be a good idea to replace <i>\u201cRotes 6\u201d</i> with <i>Rotes \u2013 choose spells with 6 total dots\u201d</i>, because Rotes don\u2019t actually have dot values anymore, but are chosen based on the dot levels of the spells at character creation.</li> <li>Replace <i>\u201cMerits 7\u201d</i> with <i>\u201cMerits 10\u201d</i></li> <li>Remove <i>\u201c(Buying the 5<sup>th</sup> dot in Attriibutes, Skills or Merits costs 2 points)\u201d</i></li> </ul><br /> <br /> I think that should do it for the small text at the bottom.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! I appreciate it.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=890988#post890988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019d also like to add that \u201cWisdom Inures\u201d sounds kind of awkward, and isn\u2019t actually a term used in the book. I think it would make more sense to change the header for that section to \u201cInured Spells\u201d.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, sure, I could do that. I only labeled it that because Wyrd had it on his mockup..<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=890988#post890988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Awesome sheet by the way! It really came together nicely, thank you to everyone who contributed, and to Mr. Gone for taking the time to put it all together.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! Glad you liked how it turned out. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=891007#post891007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have another suggestion/request, but it would take more significant alteration to the sheet, so maybe it could be an alternative version. Sorry I'm late to the party here, I understand if this would be a lower priority. Personally, I don't see myself getting much use out of the Yantras and Magical Tools lines. Maybe one line for &quot;Deadicated Magical Tool&quot;, but that'd be it. Everything else in that left-hand section could be shifted up, and the bottom of the second page could become a section labeled Attainments. On the left there could be a sort of table with 10 rows (each labeled with the name of one of the 10 Arcana) and 4 colums, labeled &quot;Counterspell&quot;, &quot;Mage Armor&quot;, &quot;Targeted Summoning&quot;, and &quot;Create Rote&quot;, and the fields could just be checkboxes. To the right of that table you could have three colums with 10 fillable lines each, labeled &quot;Lesser Utility&quot;, &quot;Greater Utility&quot;, and &quot;Legacy&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you don''t mind, send me a message or an email about this, so I don't lose track of it.<br /> <br /> Now, are you talking about removing the two attainments sections(as well as the other sections mentioned) on there currently and replacing it with the above?<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T09:00:26-07:00","id":891177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=891166#post891166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks! I appreciate it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Any time!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=891166#post891166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah, sure, I could do that. I only labeled it that because Wyrd had it on his mockup..</div> </div> </div> </div>Much appreciated.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=891166#post891166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you don''t mind, send me a message or an email about this, so I don't lose track of it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Will do.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=891166#post891166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now, are you talking about removing the two attainments sections(as well as the other sections mentioned) on there currently and replacing it with the above?</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much, yeah.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T12:14:10-07:00","id":891301,"title":"","content":"One suggestion from going thru character creation with my players, the Nimbus section is a little too short as we needed to squeeze in a short description of the long-term nimbus, immediate nimbus, tilt, and signature. Each seem to need 1 to 2 lines each. Increasing that section by a line or two would work. Shortening the Enchanted items and Combat sections by a line each to give the room I think would work without hurting those sections. <br /> <br /> As always thanks for doing this love you character sheets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1162-nazeriel","name":"nazeriel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1162_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T15:00:15-07:00","id":891386,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nazeriel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=891301#post891301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One suggestion from going thru character creation with my players, the Nimbus section is a little too short as we needed to squeeze in a short description of the long-term nimbus, immediate nimbus, tilt, and signature. Each seem to need 1 to 2 lines each. Increasing that section by a line or two would work. Shortening the Enchanted items and Combat sections by a line each to give the room I think would work without hurting those sections.<br /> <br /> As always thanks for doing this love you character sheets.</div> </div> </div> </div>LOL. It's funny, when people were proposing the sheet changes, everyone thought that section had too much room. You say it's not enough?<br /> <br /> Not that I want to discount your thoughts on it, but what does everyone else say? It'll take some work to do that, and I don't want to do it if it's not too big a deal. Know what I mean?<br /> <br /> But, if the section needs to be reworked, I'll do it. Should be it laid out differently, does it need some section titles, etc?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T15:10:15-07:00","id":891395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=891386#post891386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">LOL. It's funny, when people were proposing the sheet changes, everyone thought that section had too much room. You say it's not enough?<br /> <br /> Not that I want to discount your thoughts on it, but what does everyone else say? It'll take some work to do that, and I don't want to do it if it's not too big a deal. Know what I mean?<br /> <br /> But, if the section needs to be reworked, I'll do it. Should be it laid out differently, does it need some section titles, etc?</div> </div> </div> </div>When I looked at the sheet I also thought the section looked a bit cramped, but still manageable. If it's a lot of extra work, I don't think it would be strictly necessary, but it would be nice, maybe on that alternative sheet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T15:16:47-07:00","id":891401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=890988#post890988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I\u2019ve got you covered.<ul><li>Add <i>\u201cAspirations 3\u201d</i> <i>and \u201cObsessions \u2013 1 at Gnosis 1 or 2, 2 at Gnosis 3\u201d</i> before the Attributes section.</li> <li>Add <i>\u201c+1 dot in any Resistance Attribute\u201d</i> after <i>\u201cAttributes 5/4/3\u201d</i> and remove <i>\u201cFavored Resistance Attribute \u2013 Acanthus, Moros, Thyrsus +1 Composure; Mastigos, Obrimos: +1 Resolve\u201d</i>.</li> <li>Add <i>\u201c+1 dot of Occult if in an Order\u201d</i> after <i>\u201dSkills 11/7/4\u201d</i> and before <i>\u201c(+3 Specialties)\u201d</i></li> <li>Replace <i>\u201cArcana \u2013 2 dots in 1<sup>st</sup> Arcanum, 2 dots in 2<sup>nd</sup>, 1 dot in 3<sup>rd</sup> (two of these must be the Path\u2019s Ruling Arcana) + 1 dot in any Arcanum\u201d</i> with <i>\u201cArcana \u2013 6 dots, none over 3, at least 1 dot in each Ruling Arcanum, none in Inferior Arcanum\u201d</i></li> <li>Add <i>\u201cPraxes \u2013 1 per dot of Gnosis\u201d</i> after the Arcana section and before the Rotes section.</li> <li>It might be a good idea to replace <i>\u201cRotes 6\u201d</i> with <i>Rotes \u2013 choose spells with 6 total dots\u201d</i>, because Rotes don\u2019t actually have dot values anymore, but are chosen based on the dot levels of the spells at character creation.</li> <li>Replace <i>\u201cMerits 7\u201d</i> with <i>\u201cMerits 10\u201d</i></li> <li>Remove <i>\u201c(Buying the 5<sup>th</sup> dot in Attriibutes, Skills or Merits costs 2 points)\u201d</i></li> </ul><br /> <br /> I think that should do it for the small text at the bottom. I\u2019d also like to add that \u201cWisdom Inures\u201d sounds kind of awkward, and isn\u2019t actually a term used in the book. I think it would make more sense to change the header for that section to \u201cInured Spells\u201d.</div> </div> </div> </div>Got all that taken care of and the new sheets uploaded. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","sign