,"id":925824,"title":"","content":"Before we rush to ask Mr Gone about an Archmaster sheet, we whould wait for Dave to make other changes to it, which are rumored to bee coming sometime after errata.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2535-arthexis","name":"arthexis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-04T10:20:52-07:00","id":925954,"title":"","content":"I think about Ephemeral Beings sheet with more Corpus, for Royal Avatars and alike high-power beings. But on that level it can be easier just too mark like '3A+7L+5B', like I do in our games combat Excel...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-04T11:07:39-07:00","id":925984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>arthexis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=925824#post925824\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Before we rush to ask Mr Gone about an Archmaster sheet, we whould wait for Dave to make other changes to it, which are rumored to bee coming sometime after errata.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, it doesn't have to be an 'Archmaster' sheet. Normal mages are able to get to the trait limits I mentioned (save Arcana, which could still be added on).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T07:24:39-07:00","id":933409,"title":"","content":"Mages are pretty prone to taking Mystery Cult related merits, but fitting them into the sheet is pretty painful. Is there any &quot;Mystery Cult Sheet&quot; or something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T12:16:35-07:00","id":938264,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=882897#post882897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You know what could be great, other than a sheet? Spellcasting Cheat Sheet. I'm pretty sure you could, with some magic and formatting, compact the 4 pages of quick reference spellcasting into one horizontal A4 cheatsheet. It would be probably single most useful resource for the game, with all the Factor Tables in single place next to each other.</div> </div> </div> </div>This may be a bit late, but I actually have such a Spellcasting Cheatsheet. Only it is 2 pages instead of the 1 you asked for.<br /> I made it for my own group, but since I could not find an official or fanmade one that was shorter, let me share it with you anyway.<br /> <br /> Cheatsheet: <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/t1a26eaws560tmy/Spellcasting%20cheat%20sheet.docx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/t1a26eaws5...heet.docx?dl=0</a><br /> Cheatsheet pdf version: <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/gd2vjurtmjpvoya/Spellcasting%20cheat%20sheet.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/gd2vjurtmj...sheet.pdf?dl=0</a><br /> Tables used in the cheatsheet: <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/uhlhcbx2qwwvji2/Tables%20for%20cheatsheet.xlsx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/uhlhcbx2qw...heet.xlsx?dl=0</a><br /> <br /> Should anyone feel the need to fancy it up a bit, be my guest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12164-zaephyrus","name":"Zaephyrus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T05:17:46-07:00","id":938745,"title":"","content":"Would it actually be possible do provide the char sheet in DIN A4 format too? I don't know how much work that is, but you get those big borders, when you print a letter format on A4 paper. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11939-hardcorehannes","name":"HardcoreHannes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"200"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T19:02:19-07:00","id":939270,"title":"","content":"oooh that's cool. we might try to use these during our next game!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-15T04:27:09-07:00","id":951039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=925794#post925794\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any chance we can get an Archmaster sheet with Arcana, Attributes, and skills to 10 dots, and a write-in mana pool?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think you know the answer. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> hee hee...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=933409#post933409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mages are pretty prone to taking Mystery Cult related merits, but fitting them into the sheet is pretty painful. Is there any &quot;Mystery Cult Sheet&quot; or something?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think I have one....what would such a thing entail?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zaephyrus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=938264#post938264\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This may be a bit late, but I actually have such a Spellcasting Cheatsheet. Only it is 2 pages instead of the 1 you asked for.<br /> I made it for my own group, but since I could not find an official or fanmade one that was shorter, let me share it with you anyway.<br /> <br /> Cheatsheet: <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/t1a26eaws560tmy/Spellcasting%20cheat%20sheet.docx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/t1a26eaws5...heet.docx?dl=0</a><br /> Cheatsheet pdf version: <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/gd2vjurtmjpvoya/Spellcasting%20cheat%20sheet.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/gd2vjurtmj...sheet.pdf?dl=0</a><br /> Tables used in the cheatsheet: <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/uhlhcbx2qwwvji2/Tables%20for%20cheatsheet.xlsx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/uhlhcbx2qw...heet.xlsx?dl=0</a><br /> <br /> Should anyone feel the need to fancy it up a bit, be my guest.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, those are cool!<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HardcoreHannes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=938745#post938745\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would it actually be possible do provide the char sheet in DIN A4 format too? I don't know how much work that is, but you get those big borders, when you print a letter format on A4 paper. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>If you're talking to me, it'd most likely require a complete rebuild to make it fit that page format. Or a conversion over to photoshop or something and then enlarging it..<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-15T05:15:41-07:00","id":951052,"title":"","content":"A full fledged Mystery Cult Sheet would probably have something like...<br /> <br /> 1. It's name.<br /> 2. Space for five steps of initiation, each of which needs space for describing what kind of merit it provides (example: &quot;All initiates learn to cut through red tape to fulfill their later duties. They gain a Politics Specialty in Bureaucracy.&quot;, but also &quot;The highest-ranking Brothers and Sisters were mostly first contact survivors. They\u2019ve seen more of <br /> the God-Machine\u2019s influence than most anyone still standing. They gain a modified version of the Encyclopedic Knowledge Merit relating directly to the God-Machine.&quot;)<br /> 3. Space for name of it's controller, and for name of it's <i>secret controller </i>(example: &quot;High Priest Joahim (Silver Ladder Cryptopoly of William Blacktone)&quot;<br /> 4. Space for it's PURPOSE (example: &quot;Mammon believes in the almighty dollar, and its inherent power. Followers of Mammon are expected to <br /> obtain material wealth and power at any cost. Fortunately, their networks help initiates quickly claim promotions and transfers into more prominent areas of influence.&quot;)<br /> 5. Space for it's RELIC (similar to above)<br /> 6. Space for it's DOCTRINE (similar to above)<br /> 7. Space for listing members<br /> 8. Space for stuff like location, meetings, schedules, etc<br /> 9. Space for enemies, rivals, allies","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-15T10:53:06-07:00","id":951203,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a> Thank you! Its nice to be appreciated. By all means, feel free to provide them through your website. Which looks nice by the way.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar9102_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"9102\" data-vbnamecard=\"9102\">WHW</a> Did you get a chance to use the sheets during one of your game sessions yet? I would like to have some feedback from groups other than my own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12164-zaephyrus","name":"Zaephyrus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-15T15:00:23-07:00","id":951331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=951052#post951052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A full fledged Mystery Cult Sheet would probably have something like...<br /> <br /> 1. It's name.<br /> 2. Space for five steps of initiation, each of which needs space for describing what kind of merit it provides (example: &quot;All initiates learn to cut through red tape to fulfill their later duties. They gain a Politics Specialty in Bureaucracy.&quot;, but also &quot;The highest-ranking Brothers and Sisters were mostly first contact survivors. They\u2019ve seen more of<br /> the God-Machine\u2019s influence than most anyone still standing. They gain a modified version of the Encyclopedic Knowledge Merit relating directly to the God-Machine.&quot;)<br /> 3. Space for name of it's controller, and for name of it's <i>secret controller </i>(example: &quot;High Priest Joahim (Silver Ladder Cryptopoly of William Blacktone)&quot;<br /> 4. Space for it's PURPOSE (example: &quot;Mammon believes in the almighty dollar, and its inherent power. Followers of Mammon are expected to<br /> obtain material wealth and power at any cost. Fortunately, their networks help initiates quickly claim promotions and transfers into more prominent areas of influence.&quot;)<br /> 5. Space for it's RELIC (similar to above)<br /> 6. Space for it's DOCTRINE (similar to above)<br /> 7. Space for listing members<br /> 8. Space for stuff like location, meetings, schedules, etc<br /> 9. Space for enemies, rivals, allies</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, cool. Thanks! I'll add that to my list. If I any questions once I start, I'll send em your way. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zaephyrus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/875261-mage-2e-char-sheets?p=951203#post951203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a> Thank you! Its nice to be appreciated. By all means, feel free to provide them through your website. Which looks nice by the way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh thanks! I know it's pretty simple in format, but I think it works. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> And cool...I'll see if I can those for you sometime. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-20T14:49:20-07:00","id":954625,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar9102_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"9102\" data-vbnamecard=\"9102\">WHW</a> Take a look at this, see what you think:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/MtA_2ndED_MysteryCultSheet.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/MtA_2ndED_MysteryCultSheet.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> 404 Not Found </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsi